"foreground color."
msgstr ""
"Uporabil bo plast, ki je v ozadju, kot referenco za barve namesto barve v "
"ospredju."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/grid_brush_engine.rst:88
msgid "Fill Background"
